  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The clumsy internal layout of the ground-floor, which includes refuse and cycle storage within the entrance hallway, means that it is likely to generate foul smells and odours within this enclosed space and encourage pests. Those accessing the residential accommodation above would also first be required to pass the refuse storage to enter the building. This is considered harmful to residential amenity and does not promote waste being managed in an environmentally-friendly way. It therefore conflicts with the aims and objectives of Policies 57 and 93 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
